WEBVTT

00:02:28.240 --> 00:02:30.710
Safari ya Lauren ina mizizi kwenye
uhalisi wa maisha-

00:02:30.710 --> 00:02:32.950
California Prop 187,

00:02:32.950 --> 00:02:36.950
ambayo ilijaribu kuzuia wahamiaji bila
vibali haki za msingi za kibinadamu,

00:02:36.950 --> 00:02:39.380
kabla ilionekana kutotambulika kwenye
katiba.

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:42.990
Butler siku zote aliweka habari
zinazoendelea kwenye uandishi wake.

00:02:42.990 --> 00:02:47.360
Kwenye mwendelezo wake mwaka 1998 wa 
"Mithali ya Mpanzi", "Mithali ya Talanta,"

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:49.281
aliandika kuhusu mgombea uraisi

00:02:49.281 --> 00:02:53.591
anayewatawala Wamarekani kwa ukweli
taswira na "mikanda ya umeme."

00:02:53.591 --> 00:02:56.481
Msemo wake? "Fanya Marekani bora tena."

00:02:56.481 --> 00:02:58.341
Wakati watu wakitambua utabiri wake,

00:02:58.341 --> 00:03:01.661
Butler alivutiwa pia na kufwatilia
tena historia.